<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
    <title>{% block title %}Poulvia{% endblock %}</title>
    <style>
      body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f4f7f4; color: #17251b; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
      .page { width: 100%; padding: 28px 12px; }
      .card { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4ebe5; border-radius: 12px; }
      .header { padding: 22px 28px; background: #176b45; color: #fff; }
      .brand { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .2px; }
      .content { padding: 30px 28px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
      h1 { margin: 0 0 18px; color: #17251b; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.3; }
      p { margin: 0 0 16px; }
      .button-wrap { margin: 24px 0; }
      .button { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 18px; border-radius: 7px; background: #176b45; color: #fff !important; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
      .code { display: inline-block; margin: 4px 0 18px; padding: 12px 18px; border: 1px solid #dce8df; border-radius: 7px; background: #f4f8f5; color: #176b45; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 5px; }
      .muted { color: #607166; font-size: 13px; }
      .footer { padding: 18px 28px; border-top: 1px solid #e8eee9; color: #607166; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; }
      .footer p { margin: 0 0 8px; }
      @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) {
        .page { padding: 12px 8px; }
        .header { padding: 18px 20px; }
        .content { padding: 24px 20px; }
        .footer { padding: 16px 20px; }
        h1 { font-size: 20px; }
        .button { display: block; text-align: center; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0">{% block preheader %}{% endblock %}</div>
    <div class="page">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="header"><p class="brand">Poulvia</p></div>
        <div class="content">{% block content %}{% endblock %}</div>
        <div class="footer">
          <p>Ce message a été envoyé par Poulvia au sujet de votre compte ou de votre exploitation.</p>
          <p>Si vous n’êtes pas à l’origine de cette demande, vous pouvez ignorer ce courriel.</p>
          <p>© {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Poulvia</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
